---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About LABDECODED – Free Medical & Laboratory Calculators"
  description="LABDECODED is a free platform of accurate medical and laboratory calculators built for doctors, lab professionals, students and researchers."
>
  <div class="calculator-wrap">
    <div class="calc-header">
      <h1>About LABDECODED</h1>
      <p class="lead">Decode the Lab. Understand the Numbers.</p>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Free, accurate medical & laboratory calculators designed for real clinical and academic use.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">

      <section>
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>
          LABDECODED was built with one clear purpose: to make medical and laboratory calculations 
          <strong>faster, clearer, and more reliable</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          In hospitals, labs, and classrooms, professionals and students still waste time searching for formulas, 
          using outdated tools, or doing manual calculations that carry a risk of error.
        </p>
        <p>
          We created LABDECODED to remove that friction. Every calculator is designed to give you accurate results 
          in seconds — with transparent formulas and practical interpretation — so you can focus on what actually matters.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>What You Get</h2>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Accurate Formulas</h3>
            <p>Every calculator is based on standard, widely accepted medical and statistical formulas.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Clear Interpretation</h3>
            <p>Results are not just numbers. We help you understand what they mean in practical terms.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Fast & Clean Interface</h3>
            <p>No clutter, no login, no distractions. Just open and calculate.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card">
            <h3>Completely Free</h3>
            <p>All calculators are free to use. No accounts, no paywalls, no hidden limits.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Who It’s For</h2>
        <ul class="audience">
          <li><strong>Doctors & Clinicians</strong> — Quick calculations during patient care and rounds</li>
          <li><strong>Laboratory Professionals</strong> — Tools for quality control and daily lab work</li>
          <li><strong>Medical Students</strong> — Learn formulas with clear explanations</li>
          <li><strong>Researchers</strong> — Fast statistical and laboratory calculations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Accuracy & Responsibility</h2>
        <p>
          We take accuracy seriously. All calculators use established clinical and laboratory formulas. 
          However, LABDECODED is an <strong>educational and professional reference tool</strong> — 
          not a replacement for clinical judgment or official laboratory protocols.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="cta-box">
        <h2>Start Using LABDECODED</h2>
        <p>Explore the full library of medical and laboratory calculators.</p>
        <a href="/calculators/" class="btn">Browse All Calculators →</a>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0.3rem;
    color: #0f172a;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #64748b;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #334155;
  }

  .about-content section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .about-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.4rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    color: #0f172a;
  }

  .feature-card p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #475569;
  }

  .audience {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .audience li {
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .cta-box {
    background: #f0f9ff;
    border: 1px solid #bae6fd;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-box h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    background: #0284c7;
    color: white;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .btn:hover {
    background: #0369a1;
  }
</style>